message: If you use Tunelito, please cite it using this metadata.
title: Tunelito
abstract: >-
  A one-click desktop app that lets a trusted helper SSH into a computer
  behind NAT, using a Cloudflare quick tunnel and a dedicated unprivileged
  account.
